    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d530">

                <pb facs="0713" n="589" xml:id="pg589"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">881.512/30: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé at Tangier</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Rand</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-06-29T13:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 29, 1923—1
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>14. Your June 26, 3 p.m.</p>
                <p>Confer informally with your Dutch colleague and with the representatives of other
                    Governments whose nationals and protégés are not paying the consumption tax in
                    the sense of the last paragraph of the Department’s instruction number 260, May
                    8, 1923, and report by cable.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
